{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43925","headline":"古兴 二 · 赵氏","name":"古兴 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金菊延清霜，玉壶多美酒。\n良人犹不归，芳菲岂常有。\n不惜芳菲歇，但伤别离久。\n含情罢斟酌，凝怨对窗牖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}